                "DIDIHUB reserves the right to cancel scores or withhold prizes due to obvious errors, technical failures, cheating or collusion with other players.": "DIDIHUB berhak membatalkan skor atau menahan hadiah karena kesalahan nyata, kegagalan teknis, kecurangan atau kolusi dengan pemain lain.",
